# Set these on the NEW Netlify site only. Do not commit real values.
# Do not add them to the cupspace.com.au site.
# PIPELINE_ADMIN_PASSWORD must be at least 8 characters.
# PIPELINE_SESSION_SECRET must be at least 32 characters. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
